  "description": "Located in the territory of Parentium (Pore\u010d, Croatia), Loron was one of the largest Dressel 6B amphorae workshops in Adriatic (1st-4th centuries CE). It belonged to important senators like Sisenna Statilius Taurus and Calvia Crispinilla before its integration in the imperial property from the reign of Domitian (81 CE).",
